  "semantics": [
    "Complete summary dispatcher, common motion/auxiliary summary and channel statistics graph. Two window-mean bodies include shared tail entries0x9293e/0x9295c;17 ABI entries represent15 REA bodies, counted once.",
    "Live queue counts are reloaded after zeroing outputs, preserving count/output aliases. Float mean adds sample before accumulator. Dot/squares preserve separately rounded VMLA behavior; first minimum ties and ordered/unordered FP comparisons are explicit.",
    "Motion uses at most125 signed16 values, keeps native variance recomputation and unsigned conversion repetitions, computes the bounded threshold, then signed RTZ mean/threshold and wrapped byte outlier count.",
    "Peak pairing uses cached history counts/buffers and live index/count reads, signed comparisons and wrapped iteration-to-window offsets. A minimum at the next maximum is excluded; a missing minimum produces an equal start/end pair.",
    "Pulse statistics retain inclusive0.85/1.15 tail gates using encoded double keys, skip a minimum at the last sample, preserve final FP condition status, and use native integer floor5/6 readiness. One-sided quartile masks clear their outlier count.",
    "Actual C heap, quartile/sort/math, constructors, rolling pushes, ratio and quality providers execute without algorithm boundary models. Source has no stock code mapped. No assembly, executable arrays or allocated writable sections are added."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "No physical optical/motion sensor or interrupt concurrency validation.",
    "The normal product is relocatable composition with83 application and22 boot imports, not a bootable complete image. Six SpO2 stages remain explicit dependencies.",
    "Private stack memory within8192 bytes below incoming SP is excluded; public RAM and heap remain fully compared at routine/stage snapshots. Caller-clobbered registers/APSR are not promised.",
    "Paired pushes check saved registers/SP after each call. Full public RAM/FPSCR snapshots are at constructors and ratio/summary/quality boundaries, not after each push.",
    "Independent finite correlation uses2e-6 absolute tolerance; exact native comparisons remain required. Other finite primitive/motion oracle results are exact, and five tail CV/mean cases use1e-6 tolerance.",
    "Zero-length minimum and malformed/corrupt descriptor/index buffers are outside the native valid-call contract. Valid wrappers can have empty queues and histories; these are tested.",
    "Preexisting transitive math/ABI providers can still contain assembly. All1742 body bytes execute, which is instruction coverage rather than exhaustive path/input coverage.",
    "REA dossier snapshots and function-body tail merging are retained explicitly; stock raw instructions and memory are used for replay."
  ],
